  "title": "NMT: Neurodiagnostic Montage Template Scalp EEG",
  "description": "A collection of 2,417 clinical scalp EEG recordings labeled as normal or abnormal, acquired with the standard 10-20 montage (19 EEG channels plus 2 reference electrodes). Recordings are stored in EDF format with variable sampling rates and durations. The dataset supports EEG-based pathology detection and normal/abnormal classification.",
